      "writtenOn": "2024-01-25T00:28:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is simply to allow network request with subscription ID set, even if the APP doesn\u0027t have NETWORK_FACTORY permission. The check of whether the caller is CarrierConfig app has been done before this check when a network request with subID is received.",
      "parentUuid": "a6717a7e_aa5b802a",
