      "writtenOn": "2024-01-26T20:35:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe there does need to be a carveout here, given that it is checked for both requests and callbacks.\n\nThat said, we should probably use the \"canBypassRestrictedNetworkPermissionCheck\" to determine whether a user should be allowed to set subscription IDs, otherwise we\u0027ll pass the CONNECTIVITY_USE_RESTRICTED_NETWORKS check, and then fail the NETOWRK_FACTORY check here.",
      "parentUuid": "9f44feed_d2c85a83",
