      "message": "You are right, I have made the changes. The minor difference is that I didn\u0027t check the CONNECTIVITY_USE_RESTRICTED_NETWORKS permission since that was not there before we made this change. So if a non Carrier Config app has CONNECTIVITY_USE_RESTRICTED_NETWORKS, but doesn\u0027t have NETWORK_FACTORY, the check will fail, the behavior remains the same befreo \u0026 after the change.",
