      "writtenOn": "2024-01-24T04:14:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is `mRequestRestrictedWifiEnabled \u0026\u0026 networkCapabilities.getSubscriptionIds().size() \u003d\u003d 1` only for WiFi?\nCan we merge with `getSubIdFromWifiTransportInfo`?\n\nWhen should we use `((WifiInfo) info).getSubscriptionId()` and `networkCapabilities.getSubscriptionIds()` respectively?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 240,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 246,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "92c671c3b9c309edca6082a5142f7178fb0192fe",
