        "id": 1947461
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-24T06:05:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Also, can isCarrierServiceUidForNetworkCapabilities return true if one of subId in getSubscriptionIds() satisfies `callingUid \u003d\u003d getCarrierServiceUidForSubId(subId)`",
      "parentUuid": "e5b59f10_a28b2b68",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 240,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 246,
        "endChar": 9
